# Host-built SPA bundle. The image builds its own via the `web` stage and the build
# stage rm -rf's this path before copying /web/dist over it, so shipping a developer's
# local output in the context is pure waste. Deferred until Step 5b because until the
# legacy static pages were deleted, this path also held tracked, shipped content.
